WEBVTT

00:02:56.297 --> 00:03:00.927
Artificial intelligence can process
data automatically

00:03:00.927 --> 00:03:03.971
from diverse, unstructured sources

00:03:03.971 --> 00:03:06.849
like invoices, consumer behavior data.

00:03:08.059 --> 00:03:13.439
It can work by modeling to better estimate
the missing information.

00:03:14.815 --> 00:03:18.569
It can simulate and ultimately
optimize emissions.

00:03:19.487 --> 00:03:21.864
Let me share an example
of how this could work.

00:03:22.907 --> 00:03:25.785
A wine and spirits international company:

00:03:25.785 --> 00:03:27.453
billions of sales,

00:03:27.453 --> 00:03:28.621
hundreds of brands,

00:03:28.621 --> 00:03:30.331
consumers across the globe.